      "content": "Choosing to disappear from the only people who have ever known you as human is not selfless; it is a cruel execution of your own pain that steals your future and isolates them further. True love is found in facing reality with professional help to break these negative patterns, rather than using abandonment as an easy, painful shortcut to silence your guilt. Please reach out to a mental health provider immediately because staying is the only way you can ever truly stop harming them.",
